# M7 \u00a79.2: VALID failure blocks navigation (message line), fixing the
# value lets the READ complete; field GET is stored on commit
text USE people
key enter
text @ 2,2 SAY "Age:" GET age SIZE 1,4 VALID age < 50
key enter
text READ
key enter
text 99
key tab
key bs
key bs
text 42
key enter
text ? age
key enter
eof
